==Battleground==
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] (100%) spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Large Red Ball]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Large Red Ball]]s (100%) spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**4 [[Large Red Ball]]s (100%) spawn, delay 10~11.67 seconds<sup>300f~350f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You should have all Normal Cats by now, just stall with Wall Cat and Macho Cat, then, once you have enough money, send out Mythical Titan Cat, you should put out some Sexy Legs Cats once you have enough, if you happen to be a experienced player, you should have Giraffe Cat/Lion Cat by then, just spam them, or if you have them, Crazed Cow Cat/Crazed Girrafe Cat/Manic Lion Cat.

